---
import ContentLayout from '../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
---

<ContentLayout
  title="Contact Us"
  description="Contact the TempoEmails team for support, feature requests, developer REST API integration, open source temp mail server inquiries, or feedback."
  keywords="disposable email rest api free, temp mail python api integration, temporary mail for nodejs developers, open source temp mail server, self hosted temporary email solution"
>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    We are always here to help! Whether you have questions about using TempoEmails, encountered a technical glitch, wish to suggest a new feature, or want to explore partnership opportunities, our dedicated team is ready to assist you.
  </p>

  <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-[#ea2804] pl-4 italic text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-400 mb-4">
    <strong>Estimated Response Time:</strong> We review all incoming inquiries and typically respond within <strong>24 to 48 business hours</strong> (Monday through Friday, UTC).
  </blockquote>

  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-4 mt-8">Direct Contact Channels</h2>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    To help us route your request to the appropriate department as quickly as possible, please select the relevant contact email below:
  </p>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8">
    <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-black/5 dark:bg-white/5 border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 space-y-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[#ea2804]">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc]">General Inquiries</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-400">
        Questions about our platform, feature suggestions, or general feedback.
      </p>
      <a href="mailto:contact@tempoemails.com" class="inline-block text-sm font-mono font-semibold text-[#ea2804] hover:underline pt-1">
        contact@tempoemails.com
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-black/5 dark:bg-white/5 border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 space-y-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[#ea2804]">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M18.364 5.636l-3.536 3.536m0 5.656l3.536 3.536M9.172 9.172L5.636 5.636m3.536 9.192l-3.536 3.536M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0zm-5 0a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"></path>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc]">Technical Support & Bugs</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-400">
        Report inbox delivery glitches, UI bugs, or connectivity errors.
      </p>
      <a href="mailto:support@tempoemails.com" class="inline-block text-sm font-mono font-semibold text-[#ea2804] hover:underline pt-1">
        support@tempoemails.com
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-black/5 dark:bg-white/5 border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 space-y-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[#ea2804]">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M21 13.255A23.931 23.931 0 0112 15c-3.183 0-6.22-.62-9-1.745M16 6V4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4a2 2 0 00-2 2v2m4 6h.01M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc]">Business & Partnerships</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-400">
        Advertising inquiries, domain integrations, and commercial syndication.
      </p>
      <a href="mailto:business@tempoemails.com" class="inline-block text-sm font-mono font-semibold text-[#ea2804] hover:underline pt-1">
        business@tempoemails.com
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-black/5 dark:bg-white/5 border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 space-y-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[#ea2804]">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc]">Abuse & Legal Reports</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-400">
        Report terms violations, spam originators, phishing attempts, or DMCA notices.
      </p>
      <a href="mailto:abuse@tempoemails.com" class="inline-block text-sm font-mono font-semibold text-[#ea2804] hover:underline pt-1">
        abuse@tempoemails.com
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-4 mt-8">Before You Contact Us: Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    You may find an immediate answer to your question right here:
  </p>

  <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-3 mt-6">Why didn't my verification email arrive?</h3>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    Most emails arrive within 5 to 15 seconds. If an email has not arrived:
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 mb-4">
    <li>Some external senders apply artificial delays of several minutes before triggering confirmation emails.</li>
    <li>Certain websites maintain blocklists of known disposable email domains. If a website refuses your address, try clicking the "Change Address" button to generate an inbox on an alternate domain name.</li>
    <li>Ensure the sender correctly typed the exact email address displayed on your screen.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-3 mt-6">Can I send emails using TempoEmails?</h3>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    No. TempoEmails is strictly a <strong>receive-only</strong> service. We do not permit outbound email transmission to prevent spam abuse, phishing relays, and maintain clean IP deliverability for all legitimate users.
  </p>

  <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-3 mt-6">Can I recover a deleted or expired temporary inbox?</h3>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    No. In accordance with our zero-retention privacy policy, once an inbox is deleted or its expiration timer lapses, all associated emails and metadata are permanently destroyed. We do not maintain backups or archives.
  </p>

  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-4 mt-8">Tips for Submitting Bug Reports</h2>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    When sending technical bug reports to <a href="mailto:support@tempoemails.com" class="text-[#ea2804] hover:underline">support@tempoemails.com</a>, including the following details helps our engineering team resolve issues faster:
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 mb-4">
    <li>Your browser name and version (e.g., Chrome 128, Firefox 130, Safari iOS).</li>
    <li>Your device type and operating system (e.g., macOS Sonoma, Windows 11, Android 14).</li>
    <li>The specific domain name you were using (e.g., <code>@tempoemails.com</code>).</li>
    <li>A brief description of what happened vs. what you expected to happen.</li>
    <li><strong>Security Reminder:</strong> Never share sensitive passwords, secret API keys, or personal banking data in your support correspondence.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-4 mt-8">Legal and Policy Inquiries</h2>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    For legal notices, compliance requests, and terms clarification, please refer to our legal documentation:
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 mb-4">
    <li><a href="/privacy-policy" class="text-[#ea2804] hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a> — Data processing, cookies, and privacy rights.</li>
    <li><a href="/terms-of-service" class="text-[#ea2804] hover:underline">Terms of Service</a> — User agreement and acceptable use rules.</li>
    <li><a href="/disclaimer" class="text-[#ea2804] hover:underline">Disclaimer</a> — Important service limits and liability notices.</li>
  </ul>
</ContentLayout>
